# UI Styling Standards

## Glassmorphic Panel Style
All panels must use consistent glassmorphic styling:

```css
/* ✅ Standard panel styling */
.panel {
  background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.88);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  border-radius: 12px;
}

/* ❌ Don't use solid backgrounds */
.panel {
  background: #121212;
}
```

## Panel Behavior
- Panels close on blur (clicking outside)
- Position 8px right of shrine window
- Use separate BrowserWindows, never expand main shrine

## Sprite Animation
Reference sprite frames by semantic meaning:

```javascript
// ✅ GOOD - semantic frame names
const FRAMES = {
  idle: 5,      // Group 10.png
  grep: 1,      // Group 6.png  
  glob: 3,      // Group 8.png
  searching: [0,1,2,3,4]  // Animation loop
}

// ❌ BAD - raw indices
drawFrame(5)  // What does 5 mean?
```